                <pb facs="0432" n="344" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg344"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Jackson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-07"><hi rendition="#italic">June 7,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis informs Mr. Jackson that Admiral Barker’s fleet will arrive at the
                    Piraeus on the 30th instant.)</p>
            </div>
